OL,3,GNEWSABus routes axed as part of town
OL,4,Atimetable changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of bus routes in Derbyshire
OL,7,Fare being withdrawn as "fewer people
OL,8,Fare travelling".
OL,10,FStagecoach said its services in and
OL,11,Faround Chesterfield were being amended
OL,12,Ffrom 25 October, with some fully axed
OL,13,Fand others reduced.
OL,15,FThis includes withdrawing the 5 and 38
OL,16,Fservices. The 90/90A will be withdrawn
OL,17,Fbeyond Staveley and will no longer run
OL,18,Fto Bolsover and Langwith, while the 3
OL,19,Fwill no longer operate on Saturdays.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
