OL,3,GNEWSABus routes axed as part of town
OL,4,Atimetable changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement from the firm said: "This
OL,7,Fis a nationwide trend caused by
OL,8,Fcontinued growth in online shopping and
OL,9,Fthe impact of the cost of living
OL,10,Fcrisis. As our costs also continue to
OL,11,Frise we have had to make some changes
OL,12,Faffecting poorly used parts of our
OL,13,Fnetwork."
